      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, quick question. im about to hit a heavy leg day but i think i might have had a tiny bit of peanut in my protein shake or something cuz my skin feels kinda itchy and weird. i dont think it's a big deal tho, just a little tingle. is it safe if i take my usual pre-workout powder? it's got a ton of caffeine and beta alanine in it. i really don't want to ruin my workout session.",
