      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk that sounds a bit dramatic. i've had minor reactions before and it always just goes away with a bit of time. my heart is racing a little bit right now—even before the caffeine—but i assume that's just because i'm pre-workout hyped and nervous about the allergy. if i just take a double scoop of the powder, will the extra energy help me push through and get the blood flowing to clear it out? i really don't want to waste my gym time.",
